An agricultural powerhouse, Verdant focuses on high-density, high-yield crops that can keep pace with the ballooning population count.

Verdant's compound is a working farm: greenhouses and open plots of fast, high-yield crops fed by enchanted light and water, with picnic tables at its center and a permanent hall for eating and sleeping.

Its leadership is in question. The company's head was killed, and it is choosing a new one from within; outsiders are kept out of the vote. [[Org/Verdant Holdings/People/Dr. Thrain|Dr. Thrain]] speaks for it in the meantime. Verdant keeps a grudge against the [[Org/Hildebrandt Corporation/index|Hildebrandt Corporation]] over an old scuffle.

At an All Hallows Eve party among the guests some months ago, a group from Verdant came in disguised as some of the hosts, took a number of them hostage, poured acid across the floors, and broke into a vault at the middle of the city. They were stopped. The company has since offered the Party a conditional alliance; the Party, hearing this account, keeps its distance.
